---
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Consultancy & Advisory - Velcorix Services" description="Expert consultancy and advisory services for EPC projects, shutdown management, and asset integrity. Velcorix provides technical guidance for industrial operations in UAE.">
<!-- Header (Hero) -->
    <PageHeader 
      title="Consultancy & Advisory" 
      subtitle="Execution-focused consulting to improve operational efficiency, ensure compliance, and deliver complex industrial projects across the UAE" 
      bgImage="assets/images/services/DSC_2414.JPG" 
    />

    <!-- Overview (Intro) -->
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/services/DSC_2415.JPG"
              class="img-fluid shadow intro-image"
              alt="Consultancy & Advisory"
              onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/800x400?text=Consultancy'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
            <h2 class="mb-3">Driving Measurable Results in High-Risk Project Environments</h2>
            <p>
             In the energy, construction, and industrial sectors, project failure is rarely due to a lack of equipment ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â it is caused by weak planning, inefficient processes, regulatory gaps, and poor execution control.
            </p>
            <p>
          Velcorix provides end-to-end consultancy and advisory services that support organizations at critical decision points, including:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Improve project planning and execution</li>
              <li>Meet strict HSE and regulatory requirements</li>
              <li>Optimize resource allocation and reduce costs</li>
              <li>Strengthen long-term organizational capability</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              Our role is to help clients decide correctly before they commit, and execute confidently after they do.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Scope / WhatÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s Included (Key Offerings) -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Our Consultancy & Advisory Scope</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
              <i class="fas fa-circle text-primary mt-2 me-3" style="font-size: 0.5rem;"></i>
              <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Strategic & Project Planning</h5>
                <ul class="text-muted mb-0 list-unstyled">
                  <li>Market entry and feasibility studies for industrial and infrastructure projects</li>
                  <li>Project execution planning (EPC, shutdowns, brownfield expansions)</li>
                  <li>Financial and risk modeling aligned with real project constraints</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
              <i class="fas fa-circle text-primary mt-2 me-3" style="font-size: 0.5rem;"></i>
              <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Operational Excellence</h5>
                <ul class="text-muted mb-0 list-unstyled">
                  <li>Process mapping and performance benchmarking</li>
                  <li>Lean operations and productivity improvement programs</li>
                  <li>Asset utilization and maintenance strategy optimization</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
              <i class="fas fa-circle text-primary mt-2 me-3" style="font-size: 0.5rem;"></i>
              <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Supply Chain Management</h5>
                <ul class="text-muted mb-0 list-unstyled">
                  <li>Vendor evaluation and qualification</li>
                  <li>Procurement strategy for critical equipment and services</li>
                  <li>Logistics planning for large-scale and remote projects</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
