              <div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-1">Project & Operational Strategy</h5>
                <ul class="text-muted mb-0 list-unstyled">
                  <li>Execution strategy for EPC, shutdowns, and brownfield projects</li>
                  <li>Resource planning and productivity forecasting</li>
                  <li>Schedule risk and critical path analysis</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
