                        <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary mt-1 me-3"></i>
                        <div>
                          <strong>Industry-Centered Analysis:</strong> Our recommendations reflect real constraints such as site conditions, regulatory frameworks, and workforce availability.
                        </div>
                      </li>
                      <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                         <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary mt-1 me-3"></i>
