                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Early identification of technical, financial, and compliance risks.</p>
             </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
             <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded shadow-sm h-100 text-center border">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-line text-primary mb-3 fa-2x"></i>
                <h6 class="fw-bold">Sustainable Growth</h6>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Advisory focused on long-term viability, not short-term optimization.</p>
             </div>
